 {
  "coord": "5:285",
  "verdict": "FAIL",
  "category": "reversal",
  "note": "'because' makes the Olympic victor's happiness depend on receiving only a part; source says he is deemed happy though receiving only a part.",
  "replacement": "The Olympic victor, I said, is thought happy when he receives only a part of the blessedness that is secured for our citizens. Their victory is more glorious, and their maintenance at public cost is more complete. The victory they have won is the salvation of the whole State. The crown they and their children wear is everything that life needs. They receive rewards from their country while they live, and after death an honorable burial."
 },
